WEBVTT

01:28.550 --> 01:32.440
Our Secret
EP24

01:38.520 --> 01:39.250
Come here.

01:45.570 --> 01:48.010
Isn't this the planetarium you took me to

01:48.720 --> 01:50.690
on my birthday?

01:51.720 --> 01:53.570
Why are we here?

01:54.010 --> 01:56.080
To cheer you up.

01:57.480 --> 02:01.200
Can we solve the problem by cheering me up?

02:01.930 --> 02:04.650
I've decided that no matter what happens,

02:04.890 --> 02:06.570
I'll be with you,

02:07.050 --> 02:09.330
but I'm still feeling bad.

02:10.850 --> 02:12.640
Come here. Take a seat.

02:23.050 --> 02:24.800
Why aren't you anxious at all?

02:26.160 --> 02:27.800
It's no big deal to have our betrothal cancelled.

02:28.210 --> 02:29.210
We can get engaged again.

02:31.440 --> 02:33.610
This isn't that simple.

02:34.080 --> 02:36.560
What if your mom still opposes.

02:43.560 --> 02:44.770
Your shoe lace is untied.

02:47.330 --> 02:47.920
I'll tie...

02:47.920 --> 02:48.640
Let me.

02:55.770 --> 02:58.719
How can I bother you with this?

03:24.080 --> 03:25.130
Be engaged again.

03:26.490 --> 03:27.560
Will you?

03:33.130 --> 03:36.130
I know this ring looks a bit crude,

03:39.610 --> 03:40.560
but one day I will definitely,

03:40.560 --> 03:42.160
give you a real one.

03:44.440 --> 03:45.690
If you have to blame,

03:46.800 --> 03:48.000
blame me for my eagerness.

03:50.490 --> 03:52.330
I can't wait any longer.

04:04.720 --> 04:05.720
Ding Xian,

04:07.690 --> 04:09.280
If in this world,

04:10.080 --> 04:12.330
there is one reason that we can't be together,

04:14.250 --> 04:15.690
then I'll find a thousand,

04:16.610 --> 04:17.680
ten thousand

04:18.810 --> 04:20.370
reasons why we can.

04:25.330 --> 04:27.930
For every minute of the rest of my life,

04:29.810 --> 04:31.650
I want you to be part of it.

04:36.000 --> 04:37.090
Will you say yes?

04:49.049 --> 04:50.000
I'll help you put it on.

05:05.560 --> 05:07.000
Why bother?

05:07.240 --> 05:08.330
Indeed.

05:09.370 --> 05:11.840
I thought you were testing me.

05:12.330 --> 05:14.000
How could you not tell me directly?

05:14.530 --> 05:15.090
I didn't know

05:15.280 --> 05:17.050
that those two were together already.

05:18.000 --> 05:20.560
I've been worried about our situation

05:20.890 --> 05:22.440
would bother you.

05:22.650 --> 05:24.440
Am I that snobbish to you?

05:25.490 --> 05:27.960
As long as they are happy, as a parent,

05:28.210 --> 05:29.490
I'd only be happy for them.

05:30.120 --> 05:32.560
I thought you didn't like our Xianxian,

05:32.770 --> 05:35.090
and were looking for someone better.

05:35.810 --> 05:37.810
Are you serious?

05:38.090 --> 05:39.490
For all these years, the way I treat Xianxian,

05:39.680 --> 05:40.650
didn't you know?

05:40.890 --> 05:42.840
- Okay. - I care about her almost more than you do, her own mother.

05:43.000 --> 05:45.120
Fine, It's just a misunderstanding.

05:45.400 --> 05:47.370
So it seems that, from now on,

05:48.280 --> 05:49.160
we'd be in-laws.

06:03.280 --> 06:04.370
Hurry up and packed up.

06:04.720 --> 06:06.210
We'd go to school later.

06:07.370 --> 06:09.530
Give me another minute. We still have time.

06:16.280 --> 06:17.210
Come here.

06:22.840 --> 06:24.000
Did you have the feeling that,

06:24.330 --> 06:27.370
ever since I started using your place as an occasional studio,

06:27.960 --> 06:31.330
the whole place started to look different?

06:33.120 --> 06:34.810
Look at these paintings on the wall.

06:35.530 --> 06:36.530
Don't you think,

06:36.720 --> 06:39.160
that your home get much warmer?

06:47.610 --> 06:48.890
What do you mean, my home?

06:50.210 --> 06:51.720
This is our home.

06:53.490 --> 06:54.280
Cut it off.

06:57.160 --> 06:58.960
Didn't you say that we still have time?

07:01.370 --> 07:02.810
So how about we don't go to school today?

07:28.890 --> 07:29.930
Boss, busy?

07:34.120 --> 07:35.240
Is the orange sweet?

07:41.650 --> 07:42.610
Let me have a bite.

07:43.400 --> 07:44.240
No.

07:46.120 --> 07:47.440
So it's from my sister-in-law then?

07:49.770 --> 07:52.400
It seems, now that you're in love,

07:52.610 --> 07:53.370
you've become...

07:55.370 --> 07:56.400
tenderer,

07:57.810 --> 07:58.720
and more focused.

07:59.210 --> 08:00.330
The power of love.

08:02.610 --> 08:03.610
Cut the crap.

08:05.330 --> 08:06.090
Oh right,

08:06.280 --> 08:08.160
Professor Ye wants you to go for him.

08:08.720 --> 08:10.610
I think it's probably still the thing last time.

08:11.370 --> 08:12.370
Have you made up your mind?

08:15.680 --> 08:16.400
Okay.

08:36.290 --> 08:38.679
Young lady,

08:39.210 --> 08:44.799
may I have the honor to have you come to dinner with me?

08:47.330 --> 08:48.480
Dinner?

08:56.650 --> 08:59.650
This lady seems to be in a bad mood.

09:00.770 --> 09:02.650
Nothing can't be solved

09:02.850 --> 09:07.290
by a nice dinner.

09:18.410 --> 09:19.290
What's wrong?

09:21.000 --> 09:22.680
All right, let's go have dinner, okay?

09:23.120 --> 09:24.170
I'm so hungry.

09:33.730 --> 09:34.600
What is it?

09:36.330 --> 09:38.240
Enough with that joking face.

09:39.770 --> 09:41.170
Professor Ye already told me everything.

09:44.480 --> 09:45.360
Tell me,

09:45.730 --> 09:47.770
why did you reject the opportunity to study abroad?

09:50.170 --> 09:51.970
So that's what's been bothering you?

09:53.410 --> 09:55.850
Are you still worried about that long-distance relationship thing?

09:58.330 --> 09:59.290
I just want to,

09:59.290 --> 10:01.240
spend more time with you, what's wrong with that?

10:02.480 --> 10:03.970
If I were that far away,

10:04.360 --> 10:05.920
I'd be really worried about you here.

10:06.090 --> 10:07.170
Zhou Siyue,

10:08.040 --> 10:09.770
I'm not a three-year-old.

10:10.090 --> 10:11.530
You're just pissing me off.

10:14.000 --> 10:16.800
Do not make me your excuse to stop going forward.

10:18.000 --> 10:18.600
I...

10:18.770 --> 10:19.730
You shut up.

10:21.170 --> 10:22.290
Let me talk this time.

10:28.040 --> 10:29.090
All the efforts you made,

10:29.090 --> 10:30.850
weren't they all for this?

10:32.290 --> 10:33.770
What if after ten years, twenty years,

10:33.770 --> 10:35.120
we broke up,

10:35.890 --> 10:37.120
and you thought of this,

10:37.560 --> 10:38.970
wouldn't you hate me for that?

10:38.970 --> 10:39.920
Nonsense!

10:41.240 --> 10:42.480
How could we,

10:42.480 --> 10:43.680
break up?

10:45.330 --> 10:46.480
I said what if.

10:46.480 --> 10:47.410
There is no "what if".

10:49.800 --> 10:50.890
Zhou Siyue,

10:52.730 --> 10:54.210
I just want you all the good.

10:57.240 --> 10:58.360
You talking like this,

10:59.040 --> 11:00.290
just makes me even harder to leave.

11:02.040 --> 11:03.040
Don't worry about me.

11:04.090 --> 11:05.970
I'll take care of myself.

11:06.920 --> 11:08.120
I'm not going anywhere.

11:10.770 --> 11:11.800
And you are not going anywhere either.

11:14.090 --> 11:14.800
Okay.

11:15.920 --> 11:16.850
I promise you.

11:20.600 --> 11:21.410
Promise?

11:23.410 --> 11:24.410
Fingers.

11:42.800 --> 11:43.680
Stop it.

11:50.530 --> 11:51.480
This is for you.

11:53.560 --> 11:54.650
Where did you get this?

11:54.970 --> 11:57.440
I saw it when shopping in the mall.

11:57.440 --> 11:58.410
And I bought it for you.

12:00.850 --> 12:01.600
Wait.

12:02.560 --> 12:03.770
Guess again.

12:04.650 --> 12:07.210
Is this a dinosaur or a crocodile?

12:11.120 --> 12:12.480
Crocodile.

12:15.290 --> 12:16.850
Fine, I was wrong again.

12:17.330 --> 12:18.040
It's okay.

12:19.210 --> 12:21.920
This time, it is whatever you say it is.

12:29.330 --> 12:30.360
You take this.

12:30.360 --> 12:31.210
Why?

12:34.090 --> 12:35.210
Stand over there.

12:35.410 --> 12:35.890
Why?

12:36.040 --> 12:37.330
Come on! Stand over there.

12:37.480 --> 12:38.530
Just do it.

12:39.440 --> 12:40.800
Come on!

12:41.560 --> 12:42.330
For what?

12:42.330 --> 12:43.480
Over there, over there.

12:44.290 --> 12:46.600
Stand still, right, over there.

12:49.210 --> 12:51.800
I'll draw a father-and-son portrait for you two.

12:52.850 --> 12:53.890
Hold it tighter.

12:56.480 --> 12:57.290
Is this fine?

12:57.480 --> 12:59.120
Fine. You two look really alike.

13:03.650 --> 13:05.000
My dear big brother,

13:05.290 --> 13:06.650
My dear little brother,

13:07.330 --> 13:10.480
we finally meet!

13:11.170 --> 13:14.210
Are you two having an online love affair turning offline?

13:14.800 --> 13:15.730
What are you talking about?

13:16.000 --> 13:17.000
This is online friends meeting each other.

13:17.210 --> 13:18.170
What do you mean love affair?

13:18.360 --> 13:19.170
When did you guys become,

13:19.170 --> 13:20.040
so intimate?

13:20.210 --> 13:20.970
Just now.

13:22.730 --> 13:23.680
Jokes aside,

13:24.000 --> 13:25.120
without us,

13:25.410 --> 13:26.800
you think you could get Xianxian this fast?

13:26.800 --> 13:27.600
Exactly!

13:29.040 --> 13:31.530
Indeed, today I'd like to thank you both.

13:32.210 --> 13:33.000
Come on,

13:33.770 --> 13:34.920
-Cheers. -Cheers.

13:35.090 --> 13:36.000
Cheers.

13:41.970 --> 13:42.600
Xianxian,

13:42.850 --> 13:43.680
You're home.

13:45.120 --> 13:46.970
Or should I call you sister-in-law now?

13:47.330 --> 13:48.410
Sister-in-law?

13:49.410 --> 13:49.970
Here,

13:49.970 --> 13:50.770
I'm telling you,

13:51.560 --> 13:53.120
you have no idea how many ideas the two of us

13:53.120 --> 13:54.560
gave the boss when he was after you.

13:55.920 --> 13:56.770
Is that so?

13:57.120 --> 13:58.650
What ideas were those?

13:58.890 --> 13:59.770
Not telling you.

14:00.410 --> 14:02.600
It's my home court today, let's drink.

14:02.800 --> 14:03.890
Fine, drink up.

14:04.170 --> 14:05.290
Hey sis, why don't you come join us?

14:05.530 --> 14:06.920
I'll cut you some fruit.

14:07.530 --> 14:08.410
Good wife.

14:08.850 --> 14:09.730
Here, to sister-in-law.

14:09.920 --> 14:12.170
-Come on, cheers. -Cheers!

14:19.000 --> 14:20.290
My head hurts.

14:20.850 --> 14:22.210
You shouldn't drink that much.

14:22.730 --> 14:24.440
You...don't touch me!

14:24.440 --> 14:26.440
Don't touch me!

14:28.090 --> 14:29.000
Zhou Siyue,

14:31.090 --> 14:32.330
once you're abroad,

14:33.650 --> 14:35.000
remember to send me a message.

14:36.120 --> 14:38.000
I know you too well.

14:38.600 --> 14:40.650
You keep everything inside.

14:41.120 --> 14:42.530
You won't tell me anything.

14:44.240 --> 14:45.800
You... you don't understand!

14:48.600 --> 14:50.240
Do you know how long I've been with him?

14:53.530 --> 14:54.410
Do you know what we've been through

14:54.410 --> 14:55.560
in high school?

15:00.330 --> 15:02.480
Do you know how much he's taken on for me?

15:03.800 --> 15:04.680
Do you know?

15:09.890 --> 15:11.330
You... you don't!

15:13.770 --> 15:15.090
You don't know.

15:21.650 --> 15:22.440
Okay, okay.

15:23.440 --> 15:24.290
Let's go. Let's go.

15:33.560 --> 15:34.680
Take care of him.

15:57.000 --> 15:57.890
I...

15:59.890 --> 16:02.120
don't care what other people say about you.

16:04.040 --> 16:05.290
You will definitely become,

16:05.290 --> 16:08.090
the Zhou Siyue you want to be.

16:15.090 --> 16:16.000
Take care.

17:04.090 --> 17:04.999
I don't want to go.

17:06.840 --> 17:08.120
That's not right.

17:08.719 --> 17:11.410
Come on, you've promised.

17:15.600 --> 17:17.450
Then let me hold you a little longer.

17:18.690 --> 17:19.959
Tomorrow, I won't be able to.

17:30.600 --> 17:31.570
You know,

17:32.650 --> 17:33.770
when I was young,

17:35.650 --> 17:37.960
my mom and dad rarely saw each other.

17:38.930 --> 17:40.690
Whenever they did, they'd fight.

17:41.890 --> 17:44.410
So, I thought they didn't love each other.

17:47.320 --> 17:48.360
Later,

17:50.240 --> 17:51.410
I found out that,

17:52.120 --> 17:54.320
it's not that they didn't love each other,

17:54.690 --> 17:58.570
but they love each other deep enough to trust each other,

18:00.930 --> 18:02.690
that's why they could hold on for so long.

18:04.930 --> 18:06.530
So can we.

18:09.080 --> 18:10.480
You have to wait for me to come back.

18:13.720 --> 18:14.840
I will.

18:21.810 --> 18:23.960
Okay. Promise.

18:58.450 --> 18:59.480
You saw him off?

19:08.690 --> 19:09.890
The plane's taken off.

19:15.690 --> 19:18.450
Come on! The long-distance relationship is officially on!

19:18.450 --> 19:20.120
It's a long and winding road ahead.

19:20.120 --> 19:22.480
Wait for me to accompany you in a few days.

19:38.120 --> 19:39.890
Oh no, it's too hot.

19:41.080 --> 19:42.530
Then why are you still leaning on me?

19:45.720 --> 19:46.410
I'll turn on the air...

19:48.410 --> 19:49.480
Save some electricity.

19:50.120 --> 19:52.120
Our electricity bill has already exceeded our budget.

19:53.080 --> 19:55.410
Your temperature is lower. I just want to lean on you.

19:56.650 --> 19:58.480
Fine, go ahead.

20:02.770 --> 20:03.690
It's too hot.

20:05.770 --> 20:06.960
I hate summers.

20:07.960 --> 20:10.320
My baby is definitely not gonna be born in summer.

20:14.690 --> 20:16.120
That's quite a long vision you have there.

20:19.200 --> 20:21.890
I'm just saying.

20:21.890 --> 20:23.290
I didn't say I was gonna have a baby with you.

20:25.770 --> 20:27.000
Then who are you having with?

20:28.080 --> 20:29.530
I'm not saying that I'm having a baby.

20:30.080 --> 20:31.720
I'm just saying if I have one.

20:39.320 --> 20:40.690
But seriously,

20:41.690 --> 20:43.720
if you had to pick a season,

20:44.200 --> 20:45.320
which one would you pick?

20:52.360 --> 20:53.650
Spring.

20:54.480 --> 20:55.930
I like spring too.

20:58.200 --> 21:01.200
You said that the reason you like spring

21:02.050 --> 21:03.570
is that spring is like me.

21:05.000 --> 21:06.960
I've only started to like spring

21:07.170 --> 21:09.050
after I met you.

21:10.890 --> 21:12.170
Because

21:13.480 --> 21:17.120
April has the best scenery, doesn't it?

21:19.240 --> 21:21.170
You are the April of this world,

21:22.290 --> 21:24.000
and you are Zhou Siyue of mine.

21:57.480 --> 21:58.690
Happy birthday.

21:59.240 --> 22:00.360
Am I the first one,

22:00.360 --> 22:01.770
to blow the candles with you?

22:02.000 --> 22:02.960
Childish.

22:17.810 --> 22:19.170
What did you wish for?

22:19.480 --> 22:21.120
To see you sooner.

22:21.690 --> 22:23.050
You'll see me soon.

22:23.410 --> 22:24.480
Hang on a little longer.

23:01.690 --> 23:02.450
What's wrong?

23:03.570 --> 23:05.170
Hasn't he answered you yet?

23:06.770 --> 23:08.000
I don't know what he's been up to.

23:08.240 --> 23:08.840
Next,

23:08.840 --> 23:10.840
let's welcome the Outstanding Student Representative

23:10.840 --> 23:12.050
Ding Xian,

23:12.480 --> 23:14.240
an undergraduate from Class 2 of the Computer Science Department

23:14.360 --> 23:15.170
enrolled in 2013

23:15.360 --> 23:16.450
to give us a speech.

23:17.320 --> 23:18.840
Hold it for me. I'll go up to the stage.

23:27.690 --> 23:29.530
Hello everyone, I'm Ding Xian.

23:35.410 --> 23:37.570
It's an honor to be here with you,

23:37.570 --> 23:40.170
and share the excitement and honor I'm having right now.

23:41.200 --> 23:42.200
Four years ago,

23:43.320 --> 23:45.080
full of dreams and hope, I walked

23:45.080 --> 23:47.240
into the beautiful schoolyard of Hua Qing University.

23:47.960 --> 23:50.000
During the four years, we've had laughter,

23:51.450 --> 23:52.570
tears,

23:53.720 --> 23:54.890
we've also got confused.

23:56.450 --> 23:59.810
Everyone and everything we encountered here,

24:00.360 --> 24:02.690
will come together in bits and pieces

24:03.810 --> 24:05.480
to form

24:05.840 --> 24:07.240
our best memories of youth.

24:09.480 --> 24:12.170
Happy Graduation.

24:15.810 --> 24:17.000
We've graduated!

24:18.200 --> 24:21.720
We've graduated!

24:26.080 --> 24:28.410
We've graduated!

24:29.000 --> 24:30.360
Happy graduation!

24:33.290 --> 24:34.170
What are you filming?

24:35.080 --> 24:36.530
Lou Feng, what are you doing?

24:36.810 --> 24:37.690
Stop it.

24:37.840 --> 24:38.650
Well, stop it.

24:39.240 --> 24:40.720
Let me. Let me do it.

24:40.890 --> 24:41.720
Give me a chance.

24:41.890 --> 24:43.050
Come on, stand there and let me take a picture.

24:44.050 --> 24:44.890
Camera on us.

24:45.410 --> 24:47.320
The lighting's not good here. Let's go over there.

24:47.320 --> 24:48.320
Lighting's not good?

24:49.000 --> 24:49.960
It's backlighting this way. How about now?

24:50.170 --> 24:50.840
Now it's fine. Now it's fine.

24:51.000 --> 24:52.650
Your hair, the hair, give it a fling.

24:52.840 --> 24:53.960
Right, it's good, it's good.

24:54.930 --> 24:56.600
What do you want to say at the final moment of graduation?

24:57.600 --> 24:59.570
Me! I want to get a boyfriend.

24:59.890 --> 25:02.000
I wanna try all the best food in the world.

25:02.170 --> 25:03.000
Forget about the food!

25:20.170 --> 25:21.170
Happy graduation!

25:22.450 --> 25:24.530
Why did you come back early?

25:25.000 --> 25:26.240
I'll skip your romance.

25:27.290 --> 25:28.810
Didn't you make the wish?

25:29.000 --> 25:30.650
Of course I have to come back early.

25:33.570 --> 25:35.290
You're back without a gift.

25:36.960 --> 25:37.840
I did bring one.

25:38.410 --> 25:39.240
Where?

26:00.200 --> 26:01.170
What are you filming?

26:01.290 --> 26:02.000
Did you get me in the film?

26:02.000 --> 26:02.720
I'm filming now.

26:03.320 --> 26:04.170
How's my hair?

26:04.320 --> 26:05.600
It's fine.

26:13.200 --> 26:14.120
What are you doing?

26:14.480 --> 26:15.720
Embarrassing!

26:15.890 --> 26:16.650
Cheesy!

26:16.810 --> 26:17.810
Stop it!

26:18.000 --> 26:19.200
No, we won't!

26:19.570 --> 26:20.450
Stop filming.

26:22.360 --> 26:25.170
Rock scissor paper.

26:27.770 --> 26:29.240
That doesn't count. One more time!

26:30.410 --> 26:33.480
Rock scissor paper.

26:35.840 --> 26:37.000
One last time!

26:38.360 --> 26:39.480
Last time.

26:39.650 --> 26:41.000
Whoever loses will do the dishes.

26:41.930 --> 26:45.050
Rock scissor paper.

26:49.410 --> 26:53.690
You want me to do the dishes the first day I moved in?

26:54.840 --> 26:56.120
Then you have another choice.

26:57.450 --> 27:00.170
You could help me find my passport.

27:02.960 --> 27:04.410
Fine, little lord Zhou.

27:04.810 --> 27:06.170
I must send it to my mom tomorrow.

27:09.770 --> 27:11.050
On the cabinet over there.

27:12.810 --> 27:13.960
This one?

28:44.960 --> 28:46.930
You're still keeping these?

28:55.570 --> 28:56.690
There's a box.

28:57.450 --> 28:58.320
Open it.

29:15.080 --> 29:16.000
Ding Xian,

29:17.290 --> 29:18.840
if I hadn't had you,

29:21.360 --> 29:23.000
in my life,

29:28.320 --> 29:30.690
I wouldn't be the person I am now.

29:38.200 --> 29:38.960
You know, back in high school,

29:38.960 --> 29:40.410
when I first laid eyes on you,

29:41.890 --> 29:43.200
I was thinking,

29:44.650 --> 29:46.050
how can there be

29:46.650 --> 29:48.930
such a stubborn girl in this world?

29:50.410 --> 29:52.080
One who doesn't like talking to people,

29:54.320 --> 29:56.050
wouldn't take help from others,

29:56.930 --> 29:59.530
and always does all things on her own.

30:02.080 --> 30:03.720
But what's so impressive about you is that,

30:05.080 --> 30:07.480
it seems that whatever you want to do,

30:09.450 --> 30:10.690
you can manage it.

30:16.240 --> 30:17.600
I don't know why,

30:18.690 --> 30:20.650
but I just fell for someone like you,

30:23.450 --> 30:24.770
and very,

30:25.600 --> 30:26.770
very,

30:27.290 --> 30:28.650
very much.

30:33.410 --> 30:34.480
I'm sorry,

30:38.000 --> 30:39.290
that I didn't

30:41.600 --> 30:42.840
keep previous promise.

30:45.600 --> 30:47.960
I caused you too much grief, Ding Xian.

30:50.840 --> 30:51.890
But I promise,

30:53.530 --> 30:55.080
I will make it up to you.

31:13.000 --> 31:14.890
Each equation has a solution,

31:16.120 --> 31:19.200
but love is without solution.

31:20.720 --> 31:22.960
If I had to choose an answer,

31:24.450 --> 31:25.480
then you,

31:26.200 --> 31:27.650
you are my eternal

31:28.000 --> 31:29.450
and only answer.

31:36.320 --> 31:37.240
Ding Xian,

31:39.720 --> 31:40.720
will you

31:41.450 --> 31:42.890
marry me?

32:03.080 --> 32:04.050
Actually,

32:04.890 --> 32:07.000
the one you gave me is enough.

32:07.240 --> 32:08.080
No,

32:09.120 --> 32:10.200
I promised

32:11.570 --> 32:12.890
that I'd give you a new one.

32:13.360 --> 32:15.000
And I will keep my promise.

32:17.770 --> 32:19.410
You've already put it on,

32:21.050 --> 32:22.810
but you haven't answered me yet.

32:23.530 --> 32:24.890
I've already put it on,

32:26.840 --> 32:28.480
and I'm wearing two.

32:29.770 --> 32:31.570
Isn't the answer obvious?

32:32.200 --> 32:34.080
I don't care. I want to hear it.

32:35.320 --> 32:38.000
You wanna hear it but I don't wanna say it.

32:38.930 --> 32:40.770
Come on, just let me have my wish come true.

32:47.690 --> 32:48.960
I will.

32:52.050 --> 32:54.770
No matter how many times, I will.

33:35.410 --> 33:36.290
Mr. Liu.

33:38.240 --> 33:39.080
- Mr. Liu. - Mr. Liu.

33:39.080 --> 33:39.690
Mr. Liu.

33:39.690 --> 33:40.480
You've all come back.

33:41.170 --> 33:42.320
We're back here to visit you.

33:43.600 --> 33:45.450
And you told me that there's nothing going on between you two.

33:45.770 --> 33:46.770
What did I say?

33:47.320 --> 33:48.690
I was right!

33:49.840 --> 33:50.690
By the way,

33:50.890 --> 33:53.000
wasn't there a girl from the arts class

33:53.000 --> 33:54.600
who was always together with you?

33:54.930 --> 33:55.890
Isn't she back with you?

33:56.650 --> 33:57.770
She just delivered a baby.

33:57.960 --> 33:59.000
She's been married for two years.

33:59.360 --> 34:00.320
Good for her!

34:01.050 --> 34:03.000
When will you two have a baby?

34:03.240 --> 34:05.890
Mr. Liu, she's holding her ceremony next month.

34:06.200 --> 34:08.240
Have you prepared your share of the gift money?

34:08.600 --> 34:10.760
Enough with them, what about you guys?

34:12.410 --> 34:14.970
I'll try to get things done in three years.

34:14.970 --> 34:16.410
You may rest assured.

34:17.560 --> 34:19.650
Seeing all of you being so successful,

34:19.970 --> 34:21.650
I'm so happy.

34:22.799 --> 34:24.560
Siyue, don't you have a speech to give later?

34:24.760 --> 34:25.279
Yeah.

34:25.890 --> 34:27.410
I think it's about time.

34:28.040 --> 34:29.650
So why don't you go and prepare?

34:29.799 --> 34:31.560
Okay, see you later, Mr. Liu.

34:31.650 --> 34:32.600
See you.

34:33.890 --> 34:34.890
Ding Xian,

34:35.520 --> 34:37.450
please stay for a little while. I have something to talk to you.

34:38.279 --> 34:39.120
Okay.

34:41.010 --> 34:42.410
What is it, Mr. Liu?

34:42.760 --> 34:43.600
This guy,

34:44.080 --> 34:46.120
he's all shiny now, being the honorary alumni,

34:46.120 --> 34:47.650
an upcoming star in technology and all,

34:48.210 --> 34:50.010
you'd never know, back in the days, there's one thing...

34:51.600 --> 34:53.279
You wanna study liberal arts?

34:54.210 --> 34:56.520
Zhou Siyue, you must be kidding me!

34:58.600 --> 35:00.080
Sir, I'm serious.

35:00.410 --> 35:02.490
Choosing science or liberal arts, this cannot be taken lightly.

35:02.890 --> 35:03.650
Once done,

35:03.650 --> 35:05.280
it'll determine your future.

35:05.490 --> 35:07.450
You have to think it through.

35:07.840 --> 35:10.650
I understand, science is where my interest lies.

35:10.800 --> 35:11.970
I'm not giving it up.

35:12.170 --> 35:13.840
But I could also do well in liberal arts.

35:14.010 --> 35:15.730
This is not about doing well or not.

35:15.890 --> 35:18.080
You'd be wasting your gift!

35:19.650 --> 35:21.010
I may also be

35:21.010 --> 35:22.040
gifted in liberal arts. Who knows?

35:22.170 --> 35:23.080
You...

35:23.650 --> 35:24.360
Zhou Siyue,

35:24.360 --> 35:26.210
are you out of your mind?

35:28.040 --> 35:28.930
Excuse me.

35:32.650 --> 35:34.730
Sir, this is my application form.

35:36.010 --> 35:37.360
Okay, put it right here.

35:41.760 --> 35:42.650
Zhou Siyue,

35:43.600 --> 35:44.690
I honestly hope that you

35:44.690 --> 35:46.450
consider choosing science.

35:48.490 --> 35:49.080
Yes.

35:49.970 --> 35:51.010
You're right.

35:54.560 --> 35:55.930
It is better to choose science.

35:56.760 --> 35:59.360
So this guy insisted on choosing arts before.

35:59.360 --> 36:00.650
It was because of you, right?

36:03.450 --> 36:04.490
The thing between the two of you,

36:04.840 --> 36:05.840
I understand.

36:07.040 --> 36:08.170
Okay, you could go.

36:14.250 --> 36:15.730
What did Mr. Liu say to you?

36:16.890 --> 36:17.800
Not telling.

36:18.210 --> 36:20.120
You wanna know, go ask him.

36:23.120 --> 36:25.520
That's so funny and can't let me know.

36:27.080 --> 36:28.410
Something's fishy.

36:31.120 --> 36:32.040
Xianxian.

36:34.040 --> 36:35.010
Su.

36:36.360 --> 36:37.360
How are you?

36:38.250 --> 36:39.280
Fine.

36:39.890 --> 36:40.930
It's been a while.

36:45.600 --> 36:46.560
It is.

36:48.410 --> 36:50.170
Why don't you go and wait for me in the hall?

36:52.800 --> 36:53.600
All right.

36:53.890 --> 36:55.840
It's a man's thing. Let them deal with it themselves.

36:56.040 --> 36:56.930
Let's go.

37:18.170 --> 37:19.170
Who'd know,

37:19.410 --> 37:20.600
you can play basketball.

37:21.410 --> 37:23.040
There's a lot that you don't know about me.

37:30.800 --> 37:31.800
Shall we?

37:32.450 --> 37:33.280
Let's have it.

37:43.600 --> 37:44.560
I heard that Ding Xian

37:45.170 --> 37:46.490
sent you an invitation.

37:51.040 --> 37:51.890
Relax.

37:52.360 --> 37:53.250
I'm not going.

37:54.840 --> 37:56.840
I'd probably already be abroad by then.

38:03.250 --> 38:04.360
It's okay if you come.

38:06.520 --> 38:08.560
Am I afraid that you'd take her from me?

38:10.450 --> 38:11.730
You never know.

38:21.800 --> 38:23.170
Still, I have to thank you

38:24.360 --> 38:26.040
for helping Xianxian so much.

38:27.320 --> 38:28.890
But you don't have to do that anymore.

38:49.800 --> 38:50.800
You know what,

38:51.730 --> 38:53.280
if you don't want to give that speech,

38:53.840 --> 38:55.410
I could take your place.

38:57.890 --> 38:58.800
Relax,

39:01.690 --> 39:03.040
I won't give you that chance.

39:06.450 --> 39:07.360
See you.

39:29.450 --> 39:30.730
Treat her well.

40:08.170 --> 40:09.080
Let's go.

40:09.800 --> 40:10.970
What did you guys do?

40:15.560 --> 40:16.970
Just some catching-up.

40:18.600 --> 40:20.650
Doesn't Su need to give a speech?

40:21.410 --> 40:22.690
Why do you care about him so much?

40:22.890 --> 40:23.490
Then you should...

40:26.080 --> 40:27.210
What are you talking about?

40:29.560 --> 40:32.450
Fine. He said that the speech is too boring.

40:32.450 --> 40:33.450
He's not coming.

40:34.120 --> 40:35.210
That's more like it.

40:40.600 --> 40:42.040
Where are Song Ziqi and Kong Shadi?

40:43.250 --> 40:44.690
They have something to do, and are off.

40:45.210 --> 40:46.320
Something to do?

40:48.120 --> 40:49.970
Never mind, forget about them. Let's go.

41:03.520 --> 41:04.840
This feels so familiar.

41:05.450 --> 41:06.890
For a second, I feel like I was back

41:07.320 --> 41:09.490
to when we were in the last year of high school.

41:11.800 --> 41:13.730
Many people may think

41:14.210 --> 41:16.930
everything goes so well with me.

41:17.360 --> 41:19.170
But I'm actually no different from you.

41:19.930 --> 41:21.650
There was a time

41:22.600 --> 41:25.970
when I was at great loss.

41:26.450 --> 41:28.490
But luckily for me,

41:29.280 --> 41:31.730
I met someone

41:33.360 --> 41:35.080
who's absolutely adorable,

41:35.650 --> 41:37.360
and nice.

41:38.360 --> 41:40.840
She once said to me

41:41.170 --> 41:42.760
that for a strong person,

41:43.320 --> 41:45.800
no matter what happened

41:46.690 --> 41:49.320
he's gonna carry on with his dreams.

41:52.520 --> 41:54.730
I've had my setbacks.

41:55.600 --> 41:57.600
I've fallen down the abyss.

41:58.170 --> 41:59.600
But every time I was down,

42:00.010 --> 42:01.970
she'd be there,

42:02.280 --> 42:03.840
with a naughty smile on her face, saying,

42:05.280 --> 42:06.490
Zhou Siyue,

42:07.800 --> 42:09.170
I believe in you.

42:17.170 --> 42:19.210
Actually she got it backwards.

42:20.410 --> 42:21.970
I want to tell her today

42:22.760 --> 42:23.840
that actually she

42:25.170 --> 42:27.490
is the only one who I've always held on to,

42:28.800 --> 42:30.650
and see as the truth.

42:33.600 --> 42:34.650
Ding Xian,

42:38.970 --> 42:40.120
thank you.

42:53.560 --> 42:55.010
Where are we going?

42:57.890 --> 42:59.040
You'll see.

43:00.010 --> 43:01.840
Just tell me. Why all the mystery?

43:21.890 --> 43:22.840
It's locked.

43:24.210 --> 43:26.520
Nothing can stop your husband.

43:26.890 --> 43:28.730
We're not married yet. Don't talk like that.

43:31.320 --> 43:32.170
Let's go.

43:41.730 --> 43:44.840
This place looks exactly the same as before.

43:48.520 --> 43:50.250
Feels like nothing's ever changed.

44:42.120 --> 44:43.450
Why did someone

44:43.450 --> 44:44.970
carve an "Early" on the desk?

44:48.040 --> 44:49.600
It looks weird.

44:55.520 --> 44:57.560
Was it you?

44:58.730 --> 45:00.650
Stop copying notes for Ding Xian.

45:01.250 --> 45:03.040
I'm almost finished. Two more minutes.

45:09.730 --> 45:10.760
What is this?

45:10.970 --> 45:11.800
Is it "Ding"?

45:13.210 --> 45:14.010
What?

45:17.210 --> 45:18.800
Isn't this "Early"?

45:24.760 --> 45:26.360
This is "Early".

45:30.040 --> 45:31.600
Then what's with this tick here?

45:34.280 --> 45:35.250
Is there?

45:35.890 --> 45:36.690
Yeah.

45:41.970 --> 45:42.800
Ding Xian.

45:44.730 --> 45:46.890
Now that I knew your secret,

45:47.930 --> 45:49.560
do you wanna know mine?

46:31.010 --> 46:32.010
I already know.

46:37.010 --> 46:38.560
I always knew.

48:03.010 --> 48:04.410
Why did you take my book?

48:44.320 --> 48:45.250
Why are you smiling?

48:49.600 --> 48:50.600
Let's go.
